ating\n","   TP/FP/FN and matched IoUs. No alternative one-to-one matcher is substituted.\n","6. Each predicted filament is one 2048x2048 COCO compressed-RLE CSV row. Natural\n","   zero detections receive no dummy instance. The accepted frozen file has 1312\n","   instances on175 images; all180 test IDs are accounted for in its coverage file.\n","\n","## Reproduce selected inference without training\n","\n","Install the pinned public pycocotools2.0.10 wheel before an offline run. The\n","repository has an own-account runtime preparation helper and exact requirements.\n","Leave the cell below disabled unless intentionally reproducing predictions into\n","a fresh filename. It never uploads them or changes a threshold.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"f01e0c39","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.448441Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.447926Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.454029Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.453318Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.009893,"end_time":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.455736+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.445843+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["RUN_INFERENCE = False\n","if RUN_INFERENCE:\n","    import os, subprocess, sys\n","    annotation = list(Path('/kaggle/input').rglob('MAGFiLO_1.0_Annotations_kaggle2026_train.json'))\n","    assert len(annotation) == 1\n","    environment = dict(os.environ, PYTHONPATH=str(PACKAGE/'src'))\n","    (PACKAGE/'submissions').mkdir()\n","    subprocess.run([sys.executable, '-m', 'solarseg.cli', 'infer',\n","        '--data-root', str(annotation[0].parent.parent),\n","        '--model', 'models/final_v1/model.json', '--device', 'cpu',\n","        '--output', 'submissions/reproduced_v3.csv'], cwd=PACKAGE, env=environment, check=True)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"1faf5e27","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.001526,"end_time":"2026-10-31T13:13:09.458639+00:00","exception"